<title>SWEDEN: Finnish airports Jan cargo volumes rise 8.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnish airports Jan cargo volumes rise 8.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish airports handled 7,253 tonnes of cargo in January, a rise of 8.9 percent over January 1996, Finland's civil aviation authority said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about airport activity for the month.</p>
<p> (Percent change since a year ago)	  Jan 97	  Jan 96</p>
<p> Cargo (export and import, in tonnes)	7,253	     8.9</p>
<p> Mail (incoming and outgoing, tonnes)	1,553	    -3.5</p>
<p> Landings					   17,768	     6.6</p>
<p> Passengers					839,465	    10.4</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
